<title>SOUTH KOREA: Seoul not to intervene in forex market for exports.</title>
<headline>Seoul not to intervene in forex market for exports.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korean finance minister Kang Kyong-shik said on Thursday the government would not intervene in the foreign exchange market to support exports.</p>
</text>
